guarantee: Acceptance 3 (T-124 r1#3) / I7: a refused send of the pending drop is not swallowed; the drop stays pending and is delivered once the channel has room (swallowed error at the origin: Full treated as delivered)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/call/capture.rs
added_by: test-writer
test: cargo test -p voicen-core -j2 --lib a_pending_drop
--- old
            Err(TrySendError::Full(_)) => {
                self.shared.dropped.fetch_add(v, Ordering::AcqRel);
                false
            }
--- new
            Err(TrySendError::Full(_)) => true,
--- end
